evidence.en:
A telephone call was received at 1735Z on May 26, 1986, reporting a UFO sighting. The questionnaire specified in IS/018/CCTA was used, as transcribed below:
1) 1730Z, 26 May 86;
2) the side where the sun rises, 4 to 5 objects;
3) blinking star;
4) indefinite;
5) no basis for providing information;
6) faint, indefinite colors, silver to white, changing color;
7) slow movement;
8) disordered formation;
9) no;
10) no;
11) to the right of the observation point;
12) 60 to 80 degrees relative to the h

